        "1.12.2-1.6.2.0": "Improved the death chest/shulker box drop logic.",
        "1.12.2-1.6.0.1": "Improved the death chest location search logic.",
        "1.12.2-1.6.0.0": "Unlocker items and defense entities can now be configured.",
        "1.12.2-1.5.1.6": "Improved death chest placement.",
        "1.12.2-1.5.1.5": "On Minecraft Forge 1.12.2-14.23.5.2800 and higher, enum configuration properties are now localized.",
        "1.12.2-1.5.1.4": "Improved the configuration.",
        "1.12.2-1.5.1.3": "Improved the configuration.",
        "1.12.2-1.5.1.2": "Fixed the logo not showing up in the mods list.",
        "1.12.2-1.5.1.0": "Shulker box colors can now be randomized.",
        "1.12.2-1.5.0.5": "Fixed /vdcreloadclient.",
        "1.12.2-1.5.0.4": "Death chest positions are now stored per world to avoid conflicts.",
        "1.12.2-1.5.0.3": "Fixed shulker box protection.\nFixed https://github.com/TheRandomLabs/VanillaDeathChest/issues/3",
        "1.12.2-1.5.0.2": "Minor tweaks to the configuration property comments.",
        "1.12.2-1.5.0.1": "Fixed the jar signature verification.",
        "1.12.2-1.5.0.0": "Added shulker box spawning.\nReplaced the spawning.useDoubleChests property with spawning.chestType.",
        "1.12.2-1.4.1.0": "Improved death chest placement.",
        "1.12.2-1.4.0.0": "Refactor.\nMiscellaneous fixes and improvements.",
        "1.12.2-1.3.0.0": "Added more configuration options.\nFixed death chest save data.\nImplemented death chest protection.",
        "1.12.2-1.2.0.0": "Rewrote everything. Everything is now configurable.\nAdded a configuration GUI.",
        "1.12.2-1.1.1.1": "Fixed typo.",
        "1.12.2-1.1.1.0": "Death chest coordinates are now sent in chat to the player who died.",
        "1.12.2-1.1.0.0": "Fixed Cubic Chunks and Wearable Backpacks compatibility.",
        "1.12.2-1.0.3.0": "The death chest no longer drops by default. This can be changed in the config.",
        "1.12.2-1.0.2.0": "Changed the gamerule to \"dontSpawnDeathChests\", which is false by default.",
